# Tooltip Instant Open (강제)

## Policy

- Mouse hover tooltips open **immediately** (`delayDuration={0}`).
- Do not introduce hover delay for Radix/`@/components/ui/tooltip` tooltips.

## SSOT

- Default: `web/frontend/src/components/ui/tooltip.tsx` — `TooltipProvider` defaults `delayDuration=0`, `skipDelayDuration=0`.
- App root: `web/frontend/src/App.tsx` wraps with the same values.
- Nested `TooltipProvider` / `Tooltip` must keep `delayDuration={0}` (or omit and inherit the default). Never set `200`/`300`/etc. for hover UX.

## Do / Don't

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<TooltipProvider delayDuration={200}>
<Tooltip delayDuration={300}>

// ✅ GOOD
<TooltipProvider> {/* defaults to 0 */}
<TooltipProvider delayDuration={0}>
<Tooltip delayDuration={0}>
```

Frontend notes: `web/frontend/rules.md` (Tooltip).
